# ── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Live credentials are never committed. `.env.example` is the tracked template;
# copy it to `.env` and paste your own key. This repository is private, but git
# history is permanent: a key committed once stays readable after the file is
# deleted, so a leaked key has to be rotated, not removed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Ad-hoc launcher and smoke-test scripts, written to get a server up by hand.
# Two of them carry a real NVIDIA key as a literal in `os.environ[...]` rather
# than reading `.env`, which is the one thing the rule above cannot catch: a
# file that is not named like a secret is still a file holding one. Ignored by
# name so a `git add -A` cannot sweep them in, and left in the working tree
# because they are still useful locally. Rotate any key that was pasted into
# one of these.
start_server*.py
test_qa.py
test_*_questions.py

# ── Agent Manager ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# `.kilo/worktrees/` holds full git worktree checkouts -- a second copy of every
# source file, data corpus and UI asset. Nothing in it is unique: it is generated
# by `agent_manager` and recreated on demand, and a commit that swept it in would
# duplicate the whole repository inside the repository. `.kilo/.gitignore` already
# excludes `worktrees/`, but that only protects someone who has Kilo installed,
# so the rule is repeated here for a plain `git clone`.
.kilo/

# ── Build artefacts & ephemeral runs ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Transient staging parquet and scratch databases:
sandbox_engine/_run/
sandbox_engine/staging_parquet/
graph.db/
*.parquet
data/staging/

# Graph databases are build output, not source: `python -m sandbox_engine
# --reset` regenerates them from the committed filings in ~10s, and a binary
# graph committed here only ever disagrees with the code that built it. The
# source of truth is sandbox_engine/data/, which is tracked.
*.lbug
*.lbug/

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ── OS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
